{"4004310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "To Be Altered: ACT 1", "steam_appid": 4004310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/68b727aae7774b1c65c3e8d31560b5df.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=493 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the mystery of the Ghoul's Grove, hidden in the Australian outback and filled with strange and mutilated scare actors. Darcy, an ex-detective, and his curious daughter, Jess, uncover the truth about the horrors of the carnival when they find one of the disfigured employees murdered. Play as Darcy in this multiple-choice visual novel to find out who did it, but should you have bailed when you had the chance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/3c277b61c764328de4b166b843c040b9.avif?t=1763272529\" width=93 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Darcy has a secret too, but he can't hide it from his daughter for long. Something happened to Jess' mother before Darcy quit his job, and she can't shake off the feeling that there's more to it than what he leads on. Darcy has changed, Jess has changed as well. If they stick at this place any longer, they will both be changed for the worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/84ac9ccbb00c9c704471d62eaa7a4422.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE THE GHOULS GROVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something's not quite right here, but as a retired detective, you wield all the skills necessary to crack down on the mystery. You will encounter tough decisions that will define your experience in this strange land. Every soul here depends on you for their survival, including your last remaining family member—your daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/4f368a31c6397d6fb5c71fbe5c426fe0.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=679 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DISCOVER WHO YOU ARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are many hidden truths that have yet to be noticed if only you'd just listen. How many people in the Ghouls grove are living faithful to their truth? Who knows who they are? Can the aspects of a human beings' soul be altered?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/df6abec969150473ecfa6ed08e6cd69b.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1333 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/68b727aae7774b1c65c3e8d31560b5df.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=493 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the mystery of the Ghoul's Grove, hidden in the Australian outback and filled with strange and mutilated scare actors. Darcy, an ex-detective, and his curious daughter, Jess, uncover the truth about the horrors of the carnival when they find one of the disfigured employees murdered. Play as Darcy in this multiple-choice visual novel to find out who did it, but should you have bailed when you had the chance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/3c277b61c764328de4b166b843c040b9.avif?t=1763272529\" width=93 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Darcy has a secret too, but he can't hide it from his daughter for long. Something happened to Jess' mother before Darcy quit his job, and she can't shake off the feeling that there's more to it than what he leads on. Darcy has changed, Jess has changed as well. If they stick at this place any longer, they will both be changed for the worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/84ac9ccbb00c9c704471d62eaa7a4422.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE THE GHOULS GROVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something's not quite right here, but as a retired detective, you wield all the skills necessary to crack down on the mystery. You will encounter tough decisions that will define your experience in this strange land. Every soul here depends on you for their survival, including your last remaining family member—your daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/4f368a31c6397d6fb5c71fbe5c426fe0.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1560 height=679 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DISCOVER WHO YOU ARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are many hidden truths that have yet to be noticed if only you'd just listen. How many people in the Ghouls grove are living faithful to their truth? Who knows who they are? Can the aspects of a human beings' soul be altered?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004310/extras/df6abec969150473ecfa6ed08e6cd69b.avif?t=1763272529\" width=1333 height=720 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Uncover the mystery of the Ghoul's Grove, hidden in the Australian outback and filled with strange and mutilated scare actors. To Be Altered is a multiple-ending visual novel where your choices matter, even the most minuscule decisions will decide the fates of Darcy and others.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“My absolute favorite things are the setting and character designs. The art is wonderfully gritty and colorful at the same time, and the humor is right up my alley. Well done!”<br />\r\n5/5 – sthepeasant on itch<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“This VN is SUPER well made!! The art is stunning and it's fully voice acted... The mystery and the plot is set up in a really compelling way, and the different paths give more interesting details to the story and the characters. I love how it's got equal lighthearted and emotional moments. I ADORE the characters as well, the character designs and their characterization are some of the strongest points to me. Great game!! Can't wait for the next chapter!!!”<br />\r\n5/5 – zoinkszuben on itch<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic